  "zh": "# 中美领袖会晤引全球关注，DeepSeek 桌面版及 F-Droid 2.0 等技术动态同步发布\n## AI 与科技\n- **DeepSeek Harness 桌面版发布**：首次提供本地 AI 模型调用工具，降低开发门槛。\n- **F-Droid 2.0 正式上线**：引入新架构与安全增强，标志着 Android 自由软件生态升级。\n- **Google Project Suncatcher 公布**：计划将机器学习基础设施送入轨道，探索空间计算新范式。\n## 政治外交\n- **习近平同美国总统特朗普会谈**：双方在经贸与地区安全议题上达成初步共识，影响全球格局。\n- **白宫公布国宴菜单与装饰**：融合中美文化元素，象征两国关系升温。\n## 社会民生\n- **胖东来大月饼难抢**：节日热销引发供应紧张，反映消费升级与区域品牌影响力。\n- **飞机维修人才缺口超15万**：航空业面临技术工人短缺，或推高维修成本与延误风险。",
  "en": "# US-China leaders meet amid global attention as DeepSeek desktop and F-Droid 2.0 launch highlight tech trends\n## AI & Tech\n- **DeepSeek Harness**：Provides local AI model invocation tools, lowering development barriers.\n- **F-Droid 2.0**：Introduces new architecture and security enhancements, marking an upgrade to Android free‑software ecosystem.\n- **Google Suncatcher**：Plans to put ML infrastructure in orbit, exploring a new paradigm for space‑based computing.\n## Diplomacy\n- **China-US talks**：Yield preliminary consensus on trade and regional security, shaping global dynamics.\n- **White House feast**：Blends Chinese and American cultural elements, signaling warming ties.\n## Society\n- **Giant mooncakes**：Holiday demand creates shortages, reflecting consumption upgrades and regional brand influence.\n- **Aircraft shortage**：Aviation sector faces skilled‑worker gaps, potentially raising repair costs and delay risks."
